{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经IEditionUpgradeManager提升COM接口尝试绕过UAC。对应需求：权限提升。官方：UAC Bypass Attempt with IEditionUpgradeManager Elevated COM Interface。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经IEditionUpgradeManager提升COM接口尝试绕过UAC","references":["https://github.com/hfiref0x/UACME"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"b90cdde7-7e0d-4359-8bf0-2c112ce2008a","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 权限提升","来源: 默认","对应需求: 权限提升"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.name : \"Clipup.exe\" and\n  not process.executable : \"C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\ClipUp.exe\" and process.parent.name : \"dllhost.exe\" and\n  /* CLSID of the Elevated COM Interface IEditionUpgradeManager */\n  process.parent.args : \"/Processid:{BD54C901-076B-434E-B6C7-17C531F4AB41}\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经IEditionUpgradeManager提升COM接口尝试绕过UAC\n\n### 为何重要\n获取更高权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.002","name":"Bypass User Account Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.002","name":"Bypass User Account Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1559","name":"Inter-Process Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1559/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1559.001","name":"Component Object Model","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1559/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"version":315,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
